      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WARREGO (3) has the most appealing winning profile after contesting 3yo+ BM48+ races at Kununurra, with his second to I'm A Dreamer two runs ago the clearest recent piece of form in the field. The sixth last start was plain, but he is race fit and has already placed around 1100m. MISTIFYZOU (5) resumes as the only runner with a win on the board and her record around this distance gives her a genuine chance, although she ended last campaign with two well-held runs when big odds. BRAVE HERITAGE (1) is knocking on the door after consecutive thirds at this track, most recently beaten a length after leading and being run down late. His ten-start maiden record keeps him just behind the main hopes. PRINCE OF SPARTA (2) resumes for a new stable and his Ballarat Synthetic fifth before the break had merit after covering ground, but he remains unplaced from three starts and has more to prove than the others.",
